flowchart TD
    Clients([Clients]) --> APIGateway[API Gateway]
    
    APIGateway --> ProductAlertAPI[Product/Alert API]
    ProductAlertAPI --> ProductDB[(Product DB)]
    ProductAlertAPI --> AlertDB[(Alert DB)]
    ProductAlertAPI --> CurrentPriceCache[(Current Price Cache)]
    ProductAlertAPI --> PriceEventLogTSDB[(Price Event Log / TSDB)]

    CrawlScheduler[Crawl Scheduler] --> FrontierQueue[Frontier Queue]
    CrawlScheduler --> MerchantBudget[(Merchant Budget)]
    FrontierQueue --> FetchRenderWorkers[Fetch/Render Workers]
    FetchRenderWorkers --> ParserNormalizer[Parser/Normalizer]
    FetchRenderWorkers --> CrawlDLQ[Crawl DLQ]
    ParserNormalizer --> CrawlDLQ
    CrawlDLQ --> RawArtifacts[(Raw Crawl Artifacts)]

    ParserNormalizer --> PriceIngestionAPI[Price Ingestion API]

    PriceIngestionAPI --> PriceEventLogTSDB
    PriceIngestionAPI --> PriceObservedTopic([PriceObserved Topic])
    PriceIngestionAPI --> OfferChangedTopic([OfferChanged Topic])

    PriceObservedTopic --> AlertEvaluator[Alert Evaluator]
    OfferChangedTopic --> CurrentOfferProjector[Current Offer Projector]

    CurrentOfferProjector --> CurrentPriceCache
    CurrentOfferProjector --> ProductDB

    AlertEvaluator --> AlertDB
    AlertEvaluator --> AlertMatchedTopic([AlertMatched Topic])
    
    AlertMatchedTopic --> NotificationWorkers[Notification Workers]
    NotificationWorkers --> AlertDB
